sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI LMES Operator
    participant Job as lmes-job Pod
    participant ConfigMap as Job Spec<br/>/meta/job.json
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Inference Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Callback<br/>HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Operator,Job: Phase 1: Initialization
        Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job (LMEvalJob CR)
        Job->>ConfigMap: Read /meta/job.json
        Job->>EvalHub: Status: INITIALIZING
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over Job,HF: Phase 2: Loading Data
        Job->>EvalHub: Status: LOADING_DATA
        alt Online Mode
            Job->>HF: Download benchmark datasets<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
            HF-->>Job: Datasets + tokenizer artifacts
        else Air-Gapped Mode
            Note over Job: Read from /test_data mount<br/>HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Job,Model: Phase 3: Running Evaluation
        Job->>EvalHub: Status: RUNNING_EVALUATION
        loop For each benchmark task
            Job->>Model: POST prompts via local-completions<br/>Auth: Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
            Model-->>Job: Completions response
        end
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 255)
        Note over Job,EvalHub: Phase 4: Post-Processing
        Job->>EvalHub: Status: POST_PROCESSING
        Note over Job: Compute metrics,<br/>aggregate results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Note over Job,OCI: Phase 5: Persisting Artifacts
        Job->>EvalHub: Status: PERSISTING_ARTIFACTS
        Job->>OCI: Push result OCI artifact<br/>(skopeo + olot)<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
        OCI-->>Job: Push confirmation
        opt MLflow enabled
            Job->>MLflow: Log metrics + metadata
            MLflow-->>Job: Run ID
        end
        Job->>EvalHub: Final results + metrics<br/>Status: COMPLETE
    end
